    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Body, neck, fretboard, bridge, four strings and four separate tuning machines are all modelled; the top view shows the headstock and tuner layout correctly and the side views confirm a genuinely thin hollow body. Worn wood grain runs continuously around the rim with no UV seam. 8.9k tris.",
